From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultz <alexschultz002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:31:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(conf.c): doxygen comments

Hand port of e0b51ce1 onto the patched tree, with audit verdicts:
- @file: conf.c also holds the agent settings and :exspec lines, the speller command/arguments and the search match colours.
- hls[]: run-time slot id 5 = misspelled words (spell).
- hlopts is {1, 2, 5}; lsp_ft joins the internal filetypes with a ///< comment.
Patch-added agent/spell/incsearch settings keep their existing comments.
Comments only; stripped binary identical.
---
 conf.c | 75 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 53 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

diff --git a/conf.c b/conf.c
index cc1affee..91202477 100644
--- a/conf.c
+++ b/conf.c
@@ -1,3 +1,14 @@
+/**
+ * @file conf.c
+ * @brief Compile-time configuration: filetypes, syntax highlight patterns,
